      "Before you use it, one important thing: this tool is a heuristic estimator, not an official verification system. It does not connect to Turnitin, GPTZero, or any institutional detection service. It looks at patterns in your text and makes an educated guess. Think of it like a spell-checker for robotic-sounding writing — useful, but not a final authority.",
