      "Content writer aur blogger ke liye ye tool draft ke liye acha dost hai. Outline ke points ko paragraph mein badlna, phir har paragraph ko apni research aur misalon se mazbot karna. Lekin agar blog sirf expansion se chal jaye to tehreer khali si lagegi. Apna data, apni mi sal, apni tehreer ki khushboo aap ko khud shamil karni hogi.",
