      "Sawal: Agar mera jumla Urdu mein hai to? Jawab: Roman Urdu jumla bhi diya ja sakta hai aur expansion usi lehje me aa sakta hai. Lekin achi tehreer hamesha wahi kamyaab hoti hai jis mein khayal aap ka ho, alfaz tool ke hon to bhi baat aap ki honi chahiye."
