      "The text side is template-based, and it is worth being clear about what that means. The tool has patterns for how strong titles and hooks are structured — a curiosity gap, a specific number, a named mistake, a direct promise — and slots your topic into them. Hashtag sets are assembled by mixing broad reach tags with narrower topic tags, which mirrors how experienced creators build theirs.",
      "No part of this reads the platform's algorithm, predicts performance, or copies a specific viral video. It systematizes the part of packaging that is genuinely repeatable, and leaves the judgment — what is true, funny, or interesting about your clip — to you.",
